msgid ""
"Read Fabio Burzigotti's post to learn about implementing input guardrails "
"with Open Policy Agent (OPA) for secure LLM applications. See how the "
"Quarkus Pi4J Extension makes it easier than ever to build hardware-enabled "
"applications using the Quarkus ecosystem in \"Quarkus Pi4J Extension\" by "
"Igor De Souza. Andy Damevin provides a step-by-step tutorial: build a Lit "
"web component for comments backed by a Quarkus REST API on your Roq blog in "
"\"Add Comments to Your Blog with a Web Component (30min)\". Check out "
"\"Quarkus Multitenancy Without Tenant Plumbing in Every Service\" by Markus "
"Eisele to see what the Quarkiverse Multitenancy extension gives you: one "
"resolution point, clean domain code, and three tested resolution modes for "
"database-per-tenant isolation."
msgstr ""

